hako-siv3d-games (0.1.0-1) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Initial package: the 22 game samples of the Siv3D documentation in one
    app (menu, pad and touch input, license screen). Games 1-12, 21, 22 are
    based on the MIT-licensed samples of siv3d.docs, 13-20 on the CC0 samples
    of Siv3D-Samples and Reputeless/games. OpenSiv3D (SDL3) pinned at
    a8a1f4d0b (clears the letterbox every frame).

